{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40736","headline":"和寿中丞伤猿 · 李洞","name":"和寿中丞伤猿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遗挂朱栏锁半寻，清声难买恨黄金。\n悬崖接果今何在，浅井窥星影已沉。\n归宅叶铺曾睡石，入朝灯照旧啼林。\n小山罢遶随湘客，高树休升对岳禽。\n天竺省怜伤倍切，亲知宽和思难任。\n相门恩重无由报，竟托仙郎日夜吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40736.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40736","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}